---
import IncentiveStory from './IncentiveStory.astro';

// Transferable principles live here; Villow's website owns the feature tour.
import { villowPrinciples as chapters } from '../content/villow-principles';
---

<section class="principles-story" id="design-questions" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
  <header class="ftw-shell principles-intro">
    <p class="ftw-eyebrow">From one project to a better web</p>
    <h2 id="principles-title">The principles<br />we want to build on.</h2>
    <p>Villow gives these ideas a working example on YouTube. Fix the Web asks how they could shape social media, games, messaging and the wider web. The designs will differ. The starting point is the person using them.</p>
  </header>

  <IncentiveStory />

  <div class="principle-chapters">
    {chapters.map((chapter, index) => <section class="principle-chapter" id={`principle-theme-${index}`} aria-labelledby={`chapter-${index}`}>
      <div class="ftw-shell">
        <header class="chapter-heading"><p class="chapter-label"><span>0{index + 1}</span>{chapter.theme}</p><h3 id={`chapter-${index}`}>{chapter.title}</h3></header>
        <div class="principle-pair">{chapter.principles.map(principle => <article id={principle.id}>
          <h4>{principle.title}</h4>
          <p>{principle.body}</p>
        </article>)}</div>
        <details class="project-connection"><summary><span>How this connects to Villow</span><span class="connection-plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>{chapter.connection}</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>)}
  </div>

  <section class="principles-next ftw-shell" id="beyond-the-feed" aria-labelledby="beyond-title">
    <div><p class="ftw-eyebrow">Principles into possibilities</p><h3 id="beyond-title">Different services.<br />More ways to put this into practice.</h3><p>Villow covers part of this ambition. There is more to explore: <span id="corrections">corrections that catch up with misleading claims</span>, <span id="creator-actions">actions beyond the screen</span>, considered recommendations, optional AI assistance and trustworthy discussion.</p><p>These are proposals to develop and test. The Ideas page holds their fuller explanations and open questions.</p></div>
    <a class="ftw-text-link" href="/ideas?preset=b">Explore the wider ideas <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </section>
</section>

<style>
  .principles-intro { max-width: 850px; padding-block: 88px 58px; text-align: center; }
  .principles-intro h2 { font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.8vw, 3.7rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 0 26px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .principles-intro > p:last-child { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted); }
  .principle-chapter { padding-block: 78px; }
  .principle-chapter:nth-child(odd) { background: var(--story-soft); }
  .chapter-heading { margin-bottom: 42px; }
  .chapter-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; color: var(--accent); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 850; margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .chapter-label > span { font-weight: 600; opacity: .75; }
  .chapter-heading h3 { white-space: pre-line; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem); letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance; }
  .principle-pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(36px, 7vw, 100px); }
  .principle-pair > article { scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 80px); }
  .principle-pair h4 { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.6rem); font-weight: 850; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -.02em; max-width: 450px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .principle-pair p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .project-connection { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 34px; }
  .project-connection summary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 19px 0 0; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 750; color: var(--accent); }
  .project-connection summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .connection-plus { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; }
  .project-connection[open] .connection-plus { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .project-connection > p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 800px; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.8; margin: 18px 0 0; }
  .principles-next { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; padding-block: 80px; }
  .principles-next > div { max-width: 760px; }
  .principles-next h3 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.3vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin: 0 0 24px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .principles-next p:not(.ftw-eyebrow) { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 1rem; }
  .principles-next p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .principles-next > a { flex: none; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .principles-next { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; } }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .principles-intro { padding-block: 60px 36px; }
    .principles-intro > p:last-child { font-size: 1rem; }
    .principle-chapter { padding-block: 54px; }
    .chapter-heading { margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .principle-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .principle-pair h4 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 13px; }
    .principle-pair p { font-size: 1rem; }
    .project-connection { margin-top: 28px; }
    .principles-next { padding-block: 56px; }
  }
</style>
